end about this and now  I'm getting ads uh for it so the like  listening aspect uh was something that I  was really interested in kind of  answering like the question for me like  okay well what if someone did get access  to my phone like what would they be able  to see  [Laughter]  yeah this is a really great question so  I'll repeat the question for the  recording uh the question was about uh  if for both me and my friends uh if it  was kind of a similar result having just  the like blank phone face uh staring uh  into the camera and the answer is like  for the most part yes  um with the exception of some moments  where like it's clear that there's  another person present who's being  talked to directly  um  I  I am sure there are like a few Clips  where I kind of giggle at something as  I'm like texting someone or something  like that but there weren't a lot of  those like they're not in every single  clip where a social interaction takes  place  brain  sure so the question is does it make me  feel more aware about like how I might  look in public if I'm being recorded and  I think that the honest answer is is no  that I didn't really think about that a  lot but this question probably will  change that for me  all right thank you all so much uh for  coming to my talk  [Applause]
 

